rule: This is a Wenxin artifact, not the Skills implementation layer. A recommended Skill must be backed by owner-approved evidence and satisfy one of two gates: 1) the person has a highly possible top-5-percent or high-percentile capability in this area; 2) the person repeatedly performs this kind of work and the stable inputs, process, outputs, and acceptance criteria can be abstracted. System tools, self-evolution tools, generic interests, and one-off projects must not become recommended Skills by default.
eligibility_gate:
